# RD03v2 v2: device selection on top of kuncy7's .github/ci/ipq50xx/{common,256m,kmods-extra}.config
# (v2/build.sh strips his 256m device lines). Keep his multi-profile + per-device rootfs mode.
CONFIG_TARGET_DEVICE_qualcommax_ipq50xx_DEVICE_xiaomi_mi-router-ax3000t-v2=y
# The 256 MB profiles default on only for the single-profile symbol; set them explicitly.
CONFIG_ATH11K_MEM_PROFILE_256M=y
CONFIG_NSS_MEM_PROFILE_LOW=y
CONFIG_KERNEL_BUILD_USER="rd03v2"
CONFIG_KERNEL_BUILD_DOMAIN="openwrt-xiaomi-ax3000t-rd03v2"

# What the v1.x image ships, on top of his package set.
# Full hostapd, not wpad-basic: multi-AP households run 802.11k/v (rrm_*/bss_transition) in the
# wireless config, and wpad-basic rejects those options; hostapd then refuses the whole BSS.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_wpad-mbedtls=y
# The wpad variants exclude each other at =y, and his per-device rootfs build has
# wpad-basic-mbedtls at =y by default: =m (built, not installed) is what lets wpad-mbedtls be
# =y. "is not set" would end up =m as well. config/image-must-have.txt checks the image.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_wpad-basic-mbedtls=m
# LuCI over plain HTTP (uhttpd); `luci` selects luci-light and luci-app-package-manager. Not
# luci-ssl: px5g would generate a self-signed certificate on first boot for a browser warning.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci=y
# His NSS status page, in the image since LuCI is (his image has no LuCI, so he ships it =m).
CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-app-nss=y
# Commonly wanted and tiny (#12); his kmods-extra.config has them =m only.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-tun=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-inet-diag=y
CONFIG_PACKAGE_kmod-nft-tproxy=y
# i2c-tools: /usr/sbin/nfc talks to the NFC tag with i2ctransfer, as the stock firmware does (#18).
CONFIG_PACKAGE_i2c-tools=y
# AmneziaWG (#39), packaged but not installed: it lands in our package repository, signed.
# The tools pull in kmod-amneziawg, whose dependencies are kmod-wireguard's.
CONFIG_PACKAGE_amneziawg-tools=m
CONFIG_PACKAGE_luci-proto-amneziawg=m
# ...and kept out of the generated distfeeds.list (v2/build.sh writes the image's own anyway).
# CONFIG_FEED_amneziawg is not set
